'''Takuya and Lovely Yuki''' (タクヤとビューティユキ, Takuya to byūtiyuki) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Takuya and Lovely Yuki
|appearance = [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 259.png
|money drop = 1,980¢ - 7,821¢
}}

==Enemy==
Just like [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuya]], this enemy is tanky but with low damage and a slow attack rate.  However, it boasts higher range, making it difficult to safely engage, forcing the use of backliners like Ururun while meatshields halt their advance.

